<title>POLAND: All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</title>
<headline>All Polish minimum T-bill prices fall at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at today's primary auction on total demand of 753 million zlotys against a 1.2 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>			8-WEEK  13-WEEK  26-WEEK  39-WEEK  52-week</p>
<p>   new min price    --	95.49    91.14     --	83.51</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)    --     (95.50)  (91.15)    --     (83.52)</p>
<p>   new max price    --	95.54    91.17     --	83.83</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)    --     (95.55)  (91.18)    --     (83.60)</p>
<p>   offer		--	300.0    200.0     --	700.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded    --	143.0    106.1     --	504.2</p>
<p>   bids accepted    --	135.0     80.1     --	407.1</p>
<p>   next auction     --	300.0    200.0     --	700.0</p>
<p>NOTE. Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
